  ('lgp-69002ad2c7077f0a428dac6b', 'uv-coating-machine-8dac6b', '68ec50a22ad7625f21326d7f', 'cat-industrial-automation-industrial-robots', 'UV Coating Machine', '/api/v1/media/c2fddc4f-be16-5c09-b3c5-b611bb463cad.png', 'Core Functions:
1、Surface Coating: Uniformly apply UV coatings on the surface of substrates such as paper, plastic and metal to form a transparent or functional film.
2、UV Curing: Irradiate the coated layer with UV lamps to make the photosensitizer in the coating react quickly and cure into a film instantly, without the need for long waiting time for drying.
3、Effect Customization: It can achieve a variety of surface effects, such as high-gloss, matte, tactile and abrasion-resistant, to meet the needs of different products.
Key Advantages:
1、Efficiency Advantage: The curing speed is fast, usually completed within a few seconds. This greatly shortens the production cycle and makes the machine suitable for mass continuous production.
2、Performance Advantage: The coating has strong adhesion and high flatness, which can accurately present the design effect. Additionally, the surface of the coated material has high hardness and scratch resistance.
3、Environmental Advantage: UV coatings do not contain Volatile Organic Compounds (VOCs). No harmful substances are emitted during the curing process, so the machine complies with environmental protection standards.
4、Cost Advantage: No drying equipment is required, which saves energy consumption. The coating utilization rate is high, reducing material waste and lowering production costs in the long run.', 30000, 'USD', 'Set', '1 Set', '{"Country of Origin":"China","Tags":"UV Coating Machine, Coating, Machine, UV, Circulating Inert"}'::jsonb, TRUE, '2025-10-28T02:30:42.310Z'::timestamptz, '2026-03-30T03:45:30.243Z'::timestamptz),
