  ('lgp-68e8b841b94d4c2b292ee47c', 'intelligent-fabric-inspection-machine-2ee47c', '68e8b6b1b94d4c2b292ee45f', 'cat-textile-and-leather-manufacturing', 'Intelligent Fabric Inspection Machine', '/api/v1/media/3efba976-3a0c-56e7-b8d5-62f2a936811c.png', 'Yili (Zhaoqing) Intelligent Technology Co., Ltd. was established in 1993 (formerly established as a joint venture between Duanzhou District Government of Zhaoqing City and Hong Kong Tailifa Company). It is a high-tech enterprise engaged in the research and development, production, sales and service of textile and garment equipment. Since its establishment, Yili has always focused on technological innovation. In response to the country''s implementation of the artificial intelligence-enabled manufacturing industry and the green and low-carbon development policy of the textile industry, in recent years, Yili has launched artificial intelligence fabric inspection machine, environmentally friendly fabrics washing and shrinking machine, robotic automatic trouser ironing machine and other industry-leading products.

