  ('lgp-68e8b4ebb94d4c2b292ee41c', 'mw822-high-speed-water-jet-loom-2ee41c', '68e8afb6b94d4c2b292ee3c4', 'cat-textile-and-leather-manufacturing', 'MW822 HIGH SPEED WATER JET LOOM', '/api/v1/media/eae1e446-8f07-50e0-8b66-8a3b0a727fd8.png', 'Qingdao Ming Source Machinery Technology Co., Ltd. was founded in 2002, which is specialized in the manufacture of textile machinery. With advanced CNC processing equipment and professional machinery production technology, our team can always offer research and development, production, sales and after sale service etc.. Our products are not only highly favored in China domestic market, also exported to India, Pakistan, South Korea, Turkey, Russia and other countries, where we get good international reputation. There are mainly two series of our products: water jet loom, air jet loom. Water jet looms: MW822 Water Jet Looms, MW408 heavy duty water jet loom, MW501 water jet loom.', 1000, 'USD', 'Set', '1 Set', '{"Country of Origin":"China"}'::jsonb, TRUE, '2025-10-10T07:25:31.893Z'::timestamptz, '2025-10-10T10:07:08.115Z'::timestamptz),
