  ('lgp-68dc120504c9033b0f76269e', 'ausek-camera-76269e', '68dc116304c9033b0f762693', 'cat-semiconductors', 'Ausek Camera', '/api/v1/media/1b9f95ed-5d83-53b4-bb4b-1dfb218107b4.png', 'Mainly engaged in video industry products, such as sports cameras, car recorders, children''s cameras, hunting cameras, surveillance cameras, drones and outdoor power. Ausek is an integrated company with R&D, production and sales, including B2B, B2C, brand and OEM&ODM.

