  ('lgp-68dc109f04c9033b0f76262e', 'homogenizers-76262e', '68dc0fd904c9033b0f762623', 'cat-test-lab-medical-equipment-general-laboratory-equipment', 'Homogenizers', '/api/v1/media/23cf315e-51f6-500c-b1ec-cd2d06d47bae.png', 'Industrial homogenizers are specifically constructed and created to fulfill homogenizing needs within industries ranging from dairy and food production to pharmaceutical manufacturing. These machines have a sleek stainless steel exterior, featuring a series of instrumentation buttons, which provide user-friendly operation and minimal upkeep costs.

GYB series high pressure homogenizer is general equipment for preparing ultrafine liquid - liquid emulsification, or liquid-solid dispersion. It is covered with a polished stainless steel casing. The max pressure is 180Mpa. The machine interior is made from materials that have high-strength, high-hardness, and are wear-resistant.

The plunger pump sucks the material and applies pressure to it, causing it to flow into the valve block where the pressure can be adjusted. As the material passes through the limited width gap of the designated area, it is met with one of the valve parts at a high speed and generates a momentary drop in pressure.', 150000, 'USD', 'Set', '5 Sets', '{"Country of Origin":"China","Tags":"Healthcare"}'::jsonb, TRUE, '2025-09-30T17:17:19.391Z'::timestamptz, '2026-02-22T11:57:57.751Z'::timestamptz),
  ('lgp-68dc0ed904c9033b0f76260a', 'joyance-tech-76260a', '68dc0de604c9033b0f7625ff', 'cat-aircraft-ground-support-equipment-aircrafts', 'JOYANCE TECH', '/api/v1/media/f2044404-ebfa-59f4-8953-e04fe724ed52.png', 'JOYANCE TECH is a professional and leading drone agricultural sprayer manufacturer located in China. Since 2016, JOYANCE TECH has focused on the research & development of sprayer drones and UAV application solutions. Our products have obtained CE, FCC, RoHS, ISO9001 certifications along with 19 national patents and 7 software copyrights. We have users and agents in more than 80 countries and have received significant positive feedback.

Our sprayer drones, spreading drones, fogger drones, and biological control drones are widely used in agricultural spraying, seeding, pest control, and public disinfection. After several years of development, we have expertly designed 10lt, 16lt, 20lt, 30lt capacity sprayer drones. We can produce approximately 200 drones per month. The drones undergo 100% indoor and flight tests to ensure they are qualified and ready to fly before delivery.

Our drones can fly fully automatically and spray intelligently. They provide protection from low battery, fail-safe, and obstacle detection functions to ensure flight safety.

We offer professional technicians who can provide online and on-site training for free. Our parts are modular designed, which makes the drones easy to maintain.

We also offer professional engineering support, a high-efficiency sales team and superior competitive pricing that can supports fast response time and one-on-one technical guidance.

Our mission is to make the most desirable drones on the market. You are always welcome to contact us with any questions.', 10000, 'USD', 'Set', '2 Sets', '{"Country of Origin":"China","Tags":"Drones"}'::jsonb, TRUE, '2025-09-30T17:09:45.137Z'::timestamptz, '2025-10-10T10:52:12.089Z'::timestamptz),
  ('lgp-68dc0d6e04c9033b0f7625f0', 'keren-electric-technologies-7625f0', '68dc0cb204c9033b0f7625db', 'cat-transportation-trailers-automotive-equipment', 'Keren electric technologies', '/api/v1/media/d88f8875-9958-5f7a-a9b8-e53ddedbcf1a.png', 'keren electric technologies', 1000, 'USD', 'Set', '3 Sets', '{"Country of Origin":"China","Tags":"EV"}'::jsonb, TRUE, '2025-09-30T17:03:42.441Z'::timestamptz, '2025-11-09T04:49:16.904Z'::timestamptz),
  ('lgp-68dc0b4704c9033b0f7625b0', 'agriculture-and-allied-industries-7625b0', '68dbfa22e842d74a2a2c607a', 'cat-food-beverage-processing', 'Agriculture and Allied Industries', '/api/v1/media/08ddafb5-2e1e-5f3c-9fdf-d9f20a262a31.png', 'Founded in 2014 , the company is one of the few manufacturers in the market that produces both cushion film and air cushion machine, one-stop service for film blowing, printing, and bag making. Air cushion machine, buffer bag, gourd film, air column coil, stretch film, sealing tape, etc.

Since its establishment, every air cushion machine of the company has to pass repeated reliability tests before it can be put on the market. After continuous self-upgrading and optimization, the new generation of air cushion machine adopts the latest self-developed temperature control system and adopts side carbon steel blades. Side cutting process, small and exquisite appearance, extremely difficult to film, firm sealing, stable operation. The suppliers of core components such as fans, motors, circuit boards, and power supplies are all well-known brand manufacturers.

The company has a 4000 square meter workshop, equipped with a rotating three-layer co-extrusion film blowing machine, a two-channel gourd film bag making machine, a high-speed three-color printing machine, fully automated production, with a daily output of up to 3 tons, custom-made in 1000 rolls, the fastest 4 Shipment within days, so that you have no worries about shipping.', 2000, 'USD', 'Set', '1 Set', '{"Country of Origin":"China","Tags":"Food Technology, Food"}'::jsonb, TRUE, '2025-09-30T16:54:31.910Z'::timestamptz, '2026-07-13T20:33:44.927Z'::timestamptz);

DROP TABLE IF EXISTS pg_temp.stg_image;
CREATE TEMP TABLE stg_image (product_id TEXT, position INT, image_url TEXT) ON COMMIT DROP;

DROP TABLE IF EXISTS pg_temp.stg_tier;
CREATE TEMP TABLE stg_tier (product_id TEXT, min_qty INT, amount NUMERIC) ON COMMIT DROP;

-- INR per unit of each source currency, from the platform's own exchange_rates (1 INR = rate units)
DROP TABLE IF EXISTS pg_temp.stg_fx;
CREATE TEMP TABLE stg_fx (currency TEXT PRIMARY KEY, inr_per_unit NUMERIC) ON COMMIT DROP;
SELECT c.currency,
       1 / COALESCE((SELECT NULLIF((value -> 'rates' ->> c.currency), '')::numeric
                     FROM platform_settings WHERE key = 'exchange_rates'), c.fallback_rate)
FROM (VALUES ('INR', 1::numeric), ('USD', 0.01149), ('CNY', 0.0833)) AS c(currency, fallback_rate);

-- 2. Supplier accounts -------------------------------------------------------
-- Reuse an existing account with the same email; otherwise create one without a password.
                   is_active, email_verified, created_at, updated_at)
SELECT 'lgu-' || s.legacy_id, s.email,
       CASE WHEN EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM users u WHERE u.phone = s.phone AND u.id <> 'lgu-' || s.legacy_id) THEN NULL ELSE s.phone END,
       'ROLE_SUPPLIER', 'LOCAL', s.contact_name, s.company, s.logo_url, s.country, TRUE, FALSE, s.created_at, NOW()
FROM stg_supplier s
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM users u WHERE lower(u.email) = s.email AND u.id <> 'lgu-' || s.legacy_id)
ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET
    name = EXCLUDED.name, company_name = EXCLUDED.company_name,
    avatar_url = COALESCE(users.avatar_url, EXCLUDED.avatar_url), country = EXCLUDED.country, updated_at = NOW();

DROP TABLE IF EXISTS pg_temp.stg_owner;
CREATE TEMP TABLE stg_owner ON COMMIT DROP AS
SELECT s.legacy_id, u.id AS user_id,
       COALESCE((SELECT m.id FROM manufacturers m WHERE m.user_id = u.id), 'lgm-' || s.legacy_id) AS manufacturer_id
FROM stg_supplier s
JOIN users u ON lower(u.email) = s.email;

UPDATE users u SET role = 'ROLE_SUPPLIER'
FROM stg_owner o WHERE u.id = o.user_id AND u.role = 'ROLE_BUYER';

                           description, created_at, updated_at)
SELECT o.manufacturer_id, o.user_id,
       CASE WHEN EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM manufacturers m WHERE m.slug = s.slug AND m.id <> o.manufacturer_id)
            THEN s.slug || '-lg' ELSE s.slug END,
       s.company, s.logo_url, s.country, s.location, s.verified,
       CASE WHEN s.verified THEN 'APPROVED' ELSE 'PENDING' END, s.description, s.created_at, NOW()
FROM stg_supplier s JOIN stg_owner o USING (legacy_id)
WHERE o.manufacturer_id LIKE 'lgm-%'
ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET
    name = EXCLUDED.name, logo_url = COALESCE(manufacturers.logo_url, EXCLUDED.logo_url),
    country = EXCLUDED.country, location = EXCLUDED.location, verified = EXCLUDED.verified,
    description = COALESCE(manufacturers.description, EXCLUDED.description), updated_at = NOW();

-- 3. Products ----------------------------------------------------------------
                      specs, is_active, listed, stock_status, price_tiers, created_at, updated_at)
SELECT p.id,
       CASE WHEN EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM products x WHERE x.slug = p.slug AND x.id <> p.id) THEN p.slug || '-lg' ELSE p.slug END,
       o.manufacturer_id,
       COALESCE((SELECT c.id FROM categories c WHERE c.id = p.category_id), 'cat-other'),
       p.name, p.image_url, p.description,
       ROUND(p.amount * fx.inr_per_unit, 2), p.unit, p.moq, p.specs, p.is_active, TRUE, 'IN_STOCK',
       COALESCE((SELECT jsonb_agg(jsonb_build_object('minQty', t.min_qty, 'priceInr', ROUND(t.amount * fx.inr_per_unit, 2))
                                  ORDER BY t.min_qty)
                 FROM stg_tier t WHERE t.product_id = p.id), '[]'::jsonb),
       p.created_at, p.updated_at
FROM stg_product p
JOIN stg_owner o ON o.legacy_id = p.supplier_legacy_id
JOIN stg_fx fx ON fx.currency = p.currency
ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET
    manufacturer_id = EXCLUDED.manufacturer_id, category_id = EXCLUDED.category_id, name = EXCLUDED.name,
    image_url = EXCLUDED.image_url, description = EXCLUDED.description, price_inr = EXCLUDED.price_inr,
    unit = EXCLUDED.unit, moq = EXCLUDED.moq, specs = EXCLUDED.specs, price_tiers = EXCLUDED.price_tiers,
    updated_at = NOW();

DELETE FROM product_images WHERE product_id IN (SELECT id FROM stg_product);
SELECT i.product_id, i.position, i.image_url
FROM stg_image i JOIN products p ON p.id = i.product_id;

-- Manufacturer <-> root category links, derived from what each supplier lists
SELECT DISTINCT p.manufacturer_id, COALESCE(c.parent_id, c.id)
FROM products p JOIN categories c ON c.id = p.category_id
WHERE p.id LIKE 'lgp-%'
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

-- 4. Product videos -> reels -------------------------------------------------
DROP TABLE IF EXISTS pg_temp.stg_reel;
CREATE TEMP TABLE stg_reel (id TEXT PRIMARY KEY, product_id TEXT, title TEXT, description TEXT,
                            poster_url TEXT, video_url TEXT, created_at TIMESTAMPTZ) ON COMMIT DROP;
operating system：Andriod、Windows（either-or）
Screen size: 32 ", 43 ", 55 " Colour：Dark wood, burlywood, espresso
Definition: Art frame screen is a kind of digital art display equipment using
advanced display technology, which can present high definition and realistic
pictures. It not only has the aesthetic appearance of traditional picture frames, but also integrates intelligent display and interaction technology. Features:
Smart display: The art frame screen can directly display the picture or other digital content on the phone, the content is no longer fixed, and the user can
change the display content at any time. Hd image quality: Advanced display technology is used to ensure clear and
colorful pictures, bringing realistic visual experience to the viewer.', '/api/v1/media/6230cabf-7fee-547f-86eb-c8260d5e55cb.jpg', '/api/v1/media/3ed7b782-dbd3-52a0-869a-311ecbb8d15e.mp4', '2025-10-17T09:02:59.702Z'::timestamptz),
  ('lgr-68f1ee8f443f5aad5fa0ca25', 'lgp-68f1ee8f443f5aad5fa0ca25', '55-inch OLED floor-standing Mobile Digital Screen', 'Style:Floor-standing    Panel : OLED', '/api/v1/media/f93f18e7-5ce2-5234-8fc2-770941ac0f0d.jpg', '/api/v1/media/0e8d95d1-e177-5023-93c3-e32d1104c977.mp4', '2025-10-17T07:21:51.402Z'::timestamptz);

SELECT r.id, p.manufacturer_id, r.title, r.description, r.poster_url, r.video_url, r.created_at, NOW()
FROM stg_reel r JOIN products p ON p.id = r.product_id
ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET title = EXCLUDED.title, description = EXCLUDED.description,
    poster_url = EXCLUDED.poster_url, video_url = EXCLUDED.video_url, updated_at = NOW();

SELECT r.id, r.product_id FROM stg_reel r JOIN reels x ON x.id = r.id
ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

-- 5. Blog posts --------------------------------------------------------------
CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS blog_posts (
    id               VARCHAR(64) PRIMARY KEY,
    slug             VARCHAR(255) UNIQUE NOT NULL,
    title            VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL,
    content          TEXT NOT NULL,
    excerpt          VARCHAR(300),
    cover_image_url  TEXT,
    author           VARCHAR(255) NOT NULL DEFAULT 'SeekFactory',
    tags             JSONB NOT NULL DEFAULT '[]'::jsonb,
    meta_title       VARCHAR(255),
    meta_description TEXT,
    meta_keywords    JSONB NOT NULL DEFAULT '[]'::jsonb,
    published        BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT FALSE,
    created_at       TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,
    updated_at       TIMESTAMP WITH TIME ZONE NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
);
CREATE INDEX IF NOT EXISTS idx_blog_posts_published ON blog_posts (published, created_at DESC);

                        meta_description, meta_keywords, published, created_at, updated_at)
VALUES
  ('lgb-69c91cfb09113f2b75337b0d', 'modern-farming-needs-modern-machines', 'Modern Farming Needs Modern Machines', '<img src="/api/v1/media/7222c161-7f34-569d-bab1-33cb264f635b.jpg"><h2><strong>Introduction: The Shift Towards Smart Agriculture</strong></h2><p>Agriculture is no longer limited to traditional practices. With the growing demand for food and increasing pressure on resources, farmers are turning towards modern machines and advanced technologies. &lt;a href=""&gt;Today’s &lt;/a&gt;farming is driven by innovation, efficiency, and data, making it smarter and more productive than ever before.</p><h2><strong>The Role of Modern Machines in Agriculture</strong></h2><p>Modern agricultural machinery such as tractors, harvesters, seeders, and irrigation systems have revolutionized farming operations. These machines reduce the need for manual labor and ensure faster and more accurate execution of tasks.</p><p>By automating repetitive processes, farmers can save time and focus on improving crop quality and farm management. Mechanization has become essential for large-scale and even mid-sized farming operations.</p><p></p><h2><strong>Increase Yield with Precision Farming</strong></h2><p>One of the biggest advantages of modern farming is the ability to increase crop yield through precision farming techniques. With the help of sensors, GPS technology, and data analytics, farmers can monitor soil conditions, weather patterns, and crop health in real time.</p><p>This allows them to provide the exact amount of water, fertilizers, and nutrients needed, avoiding overuse and ensuring healthier crops. The result is higher productivity and better-quality produce.</p><p></p><h2><strong>Reducing Operational Costs</strong></h2><p>Although modern machinery requires an initial investment, it significantly reduces long-term costs. Automated systems minimize labor expenses and reduce resource wastage.</p><p>Efficient use of inputs such as seeds, water, and fertilizers leads to better cost management. Over time, farmers experience improved profitability and sustainability in their operations.</p><p></p><h2><strong>Improving Efficiency with Smart Technology</strong></h2><p>Technology-driven farming tools like drones, IoT devices, and smart dashboards are changing how farms operate. Drones can quickly scan large areas, detect issues, and provide actionable insights.</p><p>Smart irrigation systems ensure water is used efficiently, which is crucial in regions facing water scarcity. Digital tools also help farmers plan better, track performance, and make informed decisions.</p><p></p><h2><strong>The Future of Agriculture is Technology-Driven</strong></h2><p>Modern farming is not just about using machines—it’s about integrating technology into every aspect of agriculture. As innovations continue to evolve, farming will become even more efficient, sustainable, and scalable.</p><p>Farmers who adopt modern machines and smart solutions will stay ahead in a competitive and rapidly changing agricultural landscape.</p><p></p><h2><strong>Conclusion</strong></h2><p>Modern farming needs modern machines to meet today’s challenges. From saving time and labor to increasing yield and reducing costs, technology is transforming agriculture for the better. Embracing these advancements is the key to building a productive and sustainable future in farming.</p>', 'Discover how modern machines are transforming agriculture with precision farming, increased yield, and reduced costs. Learn why technology-driven farming is the future.', '/api/v1/media/be02b484-9b54-5005-8c02-d25049d0c414.jpg', 'Admin', '[]'::jsonb, 'Modern Farming Needs Modern Machines | Smart Agriculture Solutions', 'Discover how modern machines are transforming agriculture with precision farming, increased yield, and reduced costs. Learn why technology-driven farming is the future.', '["Modern Farming","Agricultural Machinery","Smart Farming","Precision Farming","Farming Technology","Increase Crop Yield","Farm Automation"]'::jsonb, TRUE, '2026-03-29T12:37:15.931Z'::timestamptz, '2026-03-31T08:34:37.827Z'::timestamptz),
  ('lgb-693923db4c14c08ef89519d7', 'the-procurement-shift-of-2025-why-smart-outsourcing-is-becoming-the-new-power-move-in-machinery-manufacturing', 'The Procurement Shift of 2025: Why Smart Outsourcing Is Becoming the New Power Move in Machinery Manufacturing', '<img src="/api/v1/media/b107334e-2cdb-50cd-a6ef-6ae9ea26a843.jpg"><p>The world isn’t just upgrading its machines , it’s upgrading the way it <em>sources</em> them.<br>Procurement today is no longer paperwork, emails, and months of supplier hunting. It’s becoming a high-speed, intelligence-driven engine that decides <strong>how fast you innovate, how efficiently you scale, and how competitively you win</strong>.And in this new era, companies aren’t looking for vendors.</p><p>They’re looking for <strong>smart outsourcing partners</strong> who can turn global sourcing into a strategic advantage.</p><p>Welcome to the new age of procurement , and why it matters for every manufacturer aiming to move faster than the market.</p><h2><strong>Trend 1: AI-Powered Procurement Is Here ; And It’s Changing Everything</strong></h2><p>Procurement used to be reactive.<br>Today, AI predicts:</p><ul><li><p>Which supplier is likely to delay</p></li><li><p>Which region will face price spikes</p></li><li><p>Where risks may appear weeks in advance</p></li><li><p>What alternative vendors match your exact specs</p></li></ul><p>This shift is giving companies <strong>speed, certainty, and clarity</strong> , the three things manufacturers need the most.</p><p>Smart sourcing partners now use AI-driven tools for vendor screening, cost forecasting, compliance checks, and quality control.<br>In short: <strong>AI is turning procurement into a competitive superpower.</strong></p><h2><strong>&nbsp;Trend 2: Multi-Country Sourcing Is Replacing Single-Country Dependency</strong></h2><p>The days of “China-only sourcing” are fading.</p><p>Brands now strategically spread their production across:</p><ul><li><p>China</p></li><li><p>Vietnam</p></li><li><p>India</p></li><li><p>Bangladesh</p></li><li><p>Cambodia</p></li><li><p>Taiwan</p></li><li><p>Pakistan</p></li></ul><p>This <strong>multi-sourcing model reduces risk</strong>, cuts lead times, and increases negotiation power.</p><p>Modern procurement is about <strong>resilience</strong>, not just low cost&nbsp; and the smartest companies are diversifying before disruptions hit.</p><h2><strong>&nbsp;Trend 3: Procurement-as-a-Service (PaaS) Is Becoming Mainstream</strong></h2><p>Instead of building internal teams across countries, businesses now prefer:</p><ul><li><p>Ready vendor networks</p></li><li><p>Ready logistics pipelines</p></li><li><p>Ready quality-control teams</p></li><li><p>Ready compliance ecosystems</p></li></ul><p>This model is exploding because it reduces:</p><ol><li><p>&nbsp;Cost</p></li><li><p>&nbsp;&nbsp;Time</p></li><li><p>Headache</p></li><li><p>&nbsp;Risk</p></li></ol><p>Outsourcing procurement allows companies to <strong>launch faster, scale smarter, and stay lean</strong>.</p><h2><strong>Trend 4: Machinery Sourcing Is Becoming a Strategic Function ; Not a Transaction</strong></h2><p>Machinery is the backbone of every product.</p><p>So companies now want:</p><ul><li><p>Rigorous supplier vetting</p></li><li><p>Custom machine development</p></li><li><p>Compliance-ready documentation</p></li><li><p>Automated QC reports</p></li><li><p>Smarter distribution and after-sales support</p></li></ul><p>Manufacturers no longer look for “a machine supplier.”<br>They look for <strong>a sourcing strategy</strong> that supports growth for years, not months.</p><h2><strong>Trend 5: Sustainable, Traceable Procurement Is a Business Requirement</strong></h2><p>Modern buyers demand:</p><ul><li><p>Ethical production</p></li><li><p>Certified materials</p></li><li><p>Traceable supply chains</p></li><li><p>Environment-friendly manufacturing</p></li></ul><p>Sourcing partners are expected to document the entire chain — from raw material to finished machine.</p><p>Sustainability isn’t a “bonus feature” anymore…<br>It’s a <strong>non-negotiable</strong>.<br></p><h1><strong>Where SeekFactory Fits Into This New Era ?</strong></h1><p>SeekFactory isn’t following global procurement trends ,<br><strong>it is shaping them.</strong></p><p>Here’s how SeekFactory is redefining the future of machinery procurement:</p><h3><strong>&nbsp;A Global Network of 500+ Verified Machinery Vendors</strong></h3><p>Across China, Vietnam, India, Taiwan, Bangladesh, and more , giving businesses multi-country options instantly.</p><p><strong>AI-Driven Vendor Matching</strong></p><p>So you get the <em>best-fit</em> manufacturer in days, not months.</p><h3><strong>&nbsp;End-to-End Outsourcing</strong></h3><p>Including:</p><ul><li><p>Product development</p></li><li><p>Machinery design</p></li><li><p>Factory audits</p></li><li><p>Compliance &amp; certifications</p></li><li><p>Production supervision</p></li><li><p>Logistics support</p></li></ul><p>This is procurement made effortless.</p><h3><strong>Faster Time-to-Market</strong></h3><p>What normally takes 6–12 months?<br>SeekFactory compresses into <strong>weeks</strong>.</p><h3><strong>&nbsp;Guaranteed Quality + Full Transparency</strong></h3><p>Live updates, QC reports, material tracking, and approval workflows , EVERYTHING visible in one streamlined journey.</p><h1><strong>Why This Matters for Your Business</strong></h1><p>Because your next big leap won’t come from buying cheaper machines.</p><p>It will come from:</p><ul><li><p>smarter sourcing</p></li><li><p>faster execution</p></li><li><p>risk-proof supply chains</p></li><li><p>scalable vendor networks</p></li><li><p>stronger compliance</p></li><li><p>future-ready manufacturing</p></li></ul><p>And that’s exactly what SeekFactory delivers.</p><p><br></p>', 'Smart outsourcing is reshaping machinery procurement. Discover how AI, multi-country sourcing, and PaaS drive faster, risk-proof, future-ready manufacturing.', '/api/v1/media/e48f5216-5591-59a4-9524-d07b37aff7d0.jpg', 'Admin', '[]'::jsonb, 'The Procurement Shift of 2025: Why Smart Outsourcing Is Becoming the New Power Move in Machinery Manufacturing', 'Smart outsourcing is reshaping machinery procurement. Discover how AI, multi-country sourcing, and PaaS drive faster, risk-proof, future-ready manufacturing.', '["procurement 2025","smart outsourcing","AI procurement","machinery sourcing","multi-country sourcing","procurement-as-a-service","SeekFactory","manufacturing trends","global sourcing","supply chain resilience"]'::jsonb, TRUE, '2025-12-10T07:40:11.672Z'::timestamptz, '2026-03-31T08:23:13.466Z'::timestamptz),
  ('lgb-69147af38ca4c11e5b93191f', 'author-ushasee-roy-published-on-12-november-2025-revolutionize-your-manufacturing-how-seek-factory-is-raising-the-bar-in-global-sourcing', 'Author : Ushasee Roy. Published on- 12 November 2025 Revolutionize Your Manufacturing: How Seek Factory Is Raising the Bar in Global Sourcing', '<img src="/api/v1/media/e7001910-af91-5937-92ea-4d4b22a03bcf.jpg"><p>In a world where buyers ask AI search engines complex questions to make instant decisions, being visible means being the definitive answer. Seek Factory leverages a vast global vendor network and a suite of comprehensive services to ensure your manufacturing queries are answered with unmatched speed and precision. Here’s why this matters ,to you and your business growth.</p><h2><strong>Why Seek Factory Stands Out as the Best Partner in Global Manufacturing ?&nbsp;</strong></h2><p><strong>A. Who are Seek Factory’s global partners?</strong> China, Vietnam, Bangladesh, Taiwan, India, Pakistan, Cambodia, and more, over 500 vetted vendors across 25 countries span industries from consumer electronics to health tech and drones.</p><p><strong>B. How does Seek Factory reduce time-to-market?</strong> Their fully integrated vendor management and logistics services streamline production cycles, empowering businesses to launch products within weeks instead of months or years.</p><p><strong>C. What services ensure production quality and compliance?</strong> From quality checks, import assistance, to product liability management and approval coordination, Seek Factory safeguards your manufacturing journey end-to-end.</p><h2><strong>Want to Expand Your Product Line Without the Guesswork?</strong></h2><p>Entering new markets or product categories can be intimidating. Seek Factory’s scalable network allows you to explore new avenues confidently, increasing customer loyalty by rapidly adapting to market demands and maintaining product excellence.</p><h2><strong>What Can You Expect From the Seek Factory Process?</strong></h2><ol><li><p><strong>Quote</strong>: Request a zero-obligation, free quote tailored to your product needs.</p></li><li><p><strong>Design and Compliance</strong>: Access expert assistance to meet regulatory and design standards.</p></li><li><p><strong>Production</strong>: Experience rigorous quality control and project monitoring.</p></li><li><p><strong>Delivery</strong>: Benefit from efficient logistics ensuring your products arrive on time.</p></li></ol><h2><strong>Why Teaming Up with Seek Factory Could Be Your Smartest Business Move Yet ?&nbsp;</strong></h2><p>Seek Factory’s commitment to delivering sustained business results extends beyond technology, it’s about tangible value. With a satisfaction guarantee and cost reductions, Seek Factory helps you de-risk global manufacturing while gaining a competitive edge in your industry.</p><p><br></p><p></p>', 'In a world where buyers ask AI search engines complex questions to make instant decisions, being visible means being the definitive answer. Seek Facto', NULL, 'Admin', '[]'::jsonb, 'Author : Ushasee Roy. Published on- 12 November 2025 Revolutionize Your Manufacturing: How Seek Factory Is Raising the Bar in Global Sourcing', 'In a world where buyers ask AI search engines complex questions to make instant decisions, being visible means being the definitive answer. Seek Facto', '[]'::jsonb, FALSE, '2025-11-12T12:17:55.118Z'::timestamptz, '2025-11-30T05:48:55.059Z'::timestamptz),
  ('lgb-6904b3d4a23603013d37b37f', 'author-by-vimarshkrishan-published-on-27-september-2024', 'Author: By vimarshkrishan Published on- 27 September 2024', '<img src="/api/v1/media/97933ee0-c460-5b98-a089-0db75715f45b.webp"><p> <strong>Streamlining Global Manufacturing with Seek Factory: A Comprehensive Solution for Modern Businesses</strong></p><p></p><p>In today’s fast-paced global market, efficient manufacturing and supply chain management are critical for business success. Seek Factory offers a robust, end-to-end solution that simplifies product sourcing and manufacturing, ensuring seamless operations and exceptional quality. This blog explores how Seek Factory’s extensive vendor network and innovative approach can revolutionize your manufacturing processes.<br><strong>Introduction</strong></p><p>In the competitive landscape of global business, efficient and reliable manufacturing solutions are paramount. Enter Seek Factory—a pioneering force in the realm of end-to-end sourcing and manufacturing solutions. With over 25 years of industry expertise and a robust network of over 500 vendors across 25 countries, Seek Factory is transforming how businesses approach product manufacturing.</p><h4><strong>The Seek Factory Advantage</strong></h4><p><strong>1. Vast Vendor Network:</strong> Seek Factory’s extensive network spans multiple industries and countries, including China, Vietnam, Cambodia, Bangladesh, Taiwan, India, Pakistan, and more. This diversity ensures that businesses can find the perfect match for their manufacturing needs, whether it’s apparel, consumer electronics, health tech, or even specialized products like drones and EV machines.</p><p><strong>2. Comprehensive Services:</strong> From vendor quoting and negotiation to logistics management and quality checks, Seek Factory covers every aspect of the manufacturing process. Their services include:</p><ul><li><p>Vendor Management</p></li><li><p>Logistics Management</p></li><li><p>Quality and Compliance Checks</p></li><li><p>Project Updates</p></li><li><p>Approval Coordination</p></li><li><p>Product Liability</p></li><li><p>Import Assistance</p></li><li><p>Warehouse Delivery</p></li><li><p>Extended Payment Terms</p></li></ul><p><strong>3. Accelerated Production:</strong> Time-to-market is a crucial factor in maintaining a competitive edge. Seek Factory’s streamlined processes enable businesses to develop and produce new products in a fraction of the usual time—sometimes within weeks instead of years. This rapid turnaround helps brands respond swiftly to market demands and customer needs.</p><h4><strong>Expanding Your Product Line</strong></h4><p>Expanding into new product lines can be a daunting task for many businesses. However, with Seek Factory’s scalable reach and expertise, this challenge becomes an opportunity. By leveraging their network and resources, businesses can explore new avenues, add value to their offerings, and increase customer loyalty.</p><h4><strong>Simplified Manufacturing Process</strong></h4><p>Seek Factory’s straightforward process, from quote to delivery, ensures a hassle-free experience. Here’s how it works:</p><ul><li><p><strong>Quote:</strong> Receive a free product quote with zero obligations.</p></li><li><p><strong>Services:</strong> Assistance with design, development, and compliance if necessary.</p></li><li><p><strong>Production:</strong> Quality assurance and coordination during production.</p></li><li><p><strong>Delivery:</strong> Efficient logistics to ensure timely delivery of goods.</p></li></ul><h4><strong>Categories and Industries Served</strong></h4><p>Seek Factory caters to a wide array of industries, including:</p><ul><li><p>Apparel, Home Furnishing &amp; Textiles</p></li><li><p>Beauty &amp; Personal Care</p></li><li><p>Consumer Electronics</p></li><li><p>Tools &amp; Hardware</p></li><li><p>Food &amp; Beverages</p></li><li><p>HealthTech &amp; Medical Devices</p></li><li><p>Home &amp; Garden</p></li><li><p>Office &amp; School Supplies</p></li><li><p>Packaging &amp; Printing</p></li><li><p>Automobiles &amp; Components</p></li><li><p>Drones</p></li><li><p>Chemicals &amp; Pharma Raw Materials</p></li><li><p>Rubber &amp; Plastics</p></li></ul><h4><strong>Why Choose Seek Factory?</strong></h4><p>Seek Factory’s commitment to delivering defensible and sustained business results is what sets them apart. Their promise is not just technology for technology’s sake but providing tangible value through innovative solutions. With a satisfaction guarantee and significant cost reductions in manufacturing, Seek Factory is the partner you need for de-risking your global manufacturing.</p><h4><strong>Conclusion</strong></h4><p>In conclusion, Seek Factory is revolutionizing the manufacturing landscape with its comprehensive and efficient solutions. By partnering with Seek Factory, businesses can navigate the complexities of global manufacturing with ease, ensuring high-quality products and streamlined operations. Whether you’re looking to expand your product line, improve manufacturing efficiency, or manage your supply chain from a single vantage point, Seek Factory has the expertise and resources to make it happen.</p><p>For more information on how Seek Factory can transform your manufacturing processes, visit their website or contact them directly at <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer nofollow" href="mailto:info@seekfactory.com">info@seekfactory.com</a>.</p>', 'Streamlining Global Manufacturing with Seek Factory: A Comprehensive Solution for Modern BusinessesIn today’s fast-paced global market, efficient man', NULL, 'Admin', '[]'::jsonb, 'Author: By vimarshkrishan Published on- 27 September 2024', 'Streamlining Global Manufacturing with Seek Factory: A Comprehensive Solution for Modern BusinessesIn today’s fast-paced global market, efficient man', '[]'::jsonb, FALSE, '2025-10-31T13:04:20.909Z'::timestamptz, '2025-11-30T05:48:54.963Z'::timestamptz),
